      "id": 1,
      "text": "Parc’s name comes from PARC, the Plattsburgh Airbase Redevelopment Corporation, an acronym tied to the former military site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
